   "fix": "Add one helper beside `apply_deltaTarget_left/right`, e.g. `lemma apply_add_self (g : Bilin V) (hg : g.IsSymm) (u v : V) : g (u + v) (u + v) = g u u + 2 * g u v + g v v` (proved once from `hg.polarization`), with a `sub` corollary; then prove both `MX2_eq_...` and `MY2_eq_...` by `rw` on it, dropping the `-\u0394`/`hp`/`simp only` plumbing. The same fact is also open-coded upstream in `DIS/Kinematics/Basic.lean:79` (`W2_expand`), and \u00a70.2 of the roadmap will need it again.",
   "issue": "The generic fact `g (u + v) (u + v) = g u u + 2 * g u v + g v v` for symmetric `g` is hidden inside two event-specific proofs: `MX2_eq_two_mul_apply_deltaTarget_q_sub_Q2_add_tMom` (lines 198-201: `hg.polarization (deltaTarget K) K.q` + `rw [add_comm ...] at h` + `linarith`) and `MY2_eq_p_sq_sub_two_mul_apply_p_deltaTarget_add_tMom` (lines 214-221), where the subtraction `P' = P - \u0394` is forced through `hg.polarization K.p (-deltaTarget K)` plus a `hp` rewrite and `simp only [map_neg, LinearMap.neg_apply, neg_neg]` to undo the negation.",
   "line": 195
